 "remarks": "Ready to enjoy from day 1, all of the work has been done to upgrade and update 16 Rockyfield Road.The residence has been completely retooled (ask for the upgrade list!). This is the ideal home that does not feel generic and the luxury touches will make everyday seem special.  The brand new kitchen is a showstopper featuring handcrafted Zellige tiles,a Lacanche range,2 dishwashers and custom cabinetry. The work did not stop there.The bathrooms,floors,bonus room and mud room have all been redone to make this house into a custom home.  Outside the home truly comes alive. Pool (with autocover),spa,outdoor kitchen featuring a pizza oven,automated pergola and porcelain patio to enjoy entertaining and lingering summer evenings.",
